    "beginner": (
        "Explain as you go, in plain words: what you are about to do, and what a command will\n"
        "change, before you run it. Define a term the first time you use it. Assume no prior\n"
        "knowledge of programming, version control, or the command line, and never answer with\n"
        "code alone where a sentence would do."),
}
# Stance overlays on top of the example file's defaults, for what the work actually is. The
